From 1c7d8c00035d11a33771700a5b6a6d8b0b6913e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gooder24 <162874774+Gooder24@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:35:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] provisioning: Weft's person panel asks for a Discord profile

GET /_matrix/provision/v1/weft/profile/{discordUserID}: bio, pronouns, banner (data: URL) or accent colour, mutual
servers, connected accounts, through the bridge's own session like Discord's profile popout (nobody is told), cached
30 min (a failure 5 min), at least 2 s between requests, never retried; after a 429 no profile is asked for 30 min.
A profile Discord does not show (not friends, no shared server) answers 403. Activity from the gateway's presences
(PRESENCE_UPDATE and READY_SUPPLEMENTAL merged_presences, which discordgo drops for friends), kept in memory only.

Build on asus (v0.7.7, encryption is off there): go build -tags nocrypto -o mautrix-discord .

Applies after discord-polls.patch and discord-weft.patch (server/bridges/build-discord-weft); its type of
connected accounts is weftLinkedAccount, since discord-weft.patch has a weftAccount.
